/Author (Z.ai) /CreationDate (D:20261001190427+00'00') /Creator (Z.ai) /Keywords () /ModDate (D:20261001190427+00'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
  /Subject (The post-far-field state recorded and decided: the continuation grind formalized as termination mathematics \(the race law 0.135 bits/level, the fuel law m ~ rho^31.46 with R^2 0.974, the N* = 2 law, the width-first optimality refuting the gradient-split corollary by controlled A/B\) and stopped by its own pre-stated rule \(the wall arm STOP at the far-out replenishment, the cover4d arm HOLD at the third below-floor window 24-26-28-30-30; 29,924,011 BDC leaves + 346,400 wall certificates standing; the 1246 first stall leaves banked as margin-positive interval-width residue, every measured center at least +11.25 above lambda*, median +107\); the certificates' coverage mapped against the theorem's full domain with the completion certificate's form stated in advance; the seed-level boundary decided by the programme's first pre-registered experiment \(the scope law: the token-sheaf coboundary energy is a task-geometry diagnostic, TOST-equivalence to |rho| < 0.30 replicated at n = 96 per split; the coherence-tier law; the covariate panel's clean negative; two banked claims honestly corrected en route\) with the commissioned token-coverage-matched dose-response pool decided as a decisive negative \(the pre-registered class UNTESTED-saturation; the cliff absolute: err = 1.000 at every matched geometry 44-48/49, 2160/2160 held-out predictions failed, train accuracy 1.0000 in all 720 runs, wrong-confidence 0.749; E's own coverage dose real and monotone 0.5699 to 0.5491, Spearman 0.899\); the method itself measured \(reproduction-first and its catches, the five typed certificate tiers with the new PRE-REGISTERED tier, the A/B-before-edit rule, the plateau and transient-profile instrument laws\); the synthesis statement in final form with the unification map's final face \(every bridge solid, every dashed line decided or explicitly outside the mathematics\); and the ledger forward at zero open mathematical links \204 47 task batteries, 14 volumes, every verdict machine-anchored.) /Title (The Post-Far-Field State: the Grind Certified, the Boundary Decided, and the Method Itself Measured \204 The Resolution Programme, Volume XIV) /Trapped /False
>>
endobj
